spice
* SPICE Netlist

V1 1 0 DC V_S          ; Voltage source V_S
R1 1 2 1000            ; Resistor connected to V_S
RZ 2 0 1000            ; Resistor R_Z
V2 3 0 DC V_L          ; Voltage source V_L

C1 2 0 1uF             ; Capacitor connected to R_Z
C2 3 0 1uF             ; Capacitor connected to V_L

.END